# Pairs with CausalOrder. The tree's watermark is the maximum over its partition shippers rather than
# the minimum, so it vouches for writes a slower partition has not had acknowledged.
MODULE: CausalOrderLowWatermarkMaxOverShippers
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: S is the maximum over the tree's partition shippers, so it passes a partition that has not acknowledged
PERTURBS: Heartbeat

--- FIND
    /\ SOf > srcv
    /\ srcv' = SOf
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the maximum over shippers.
    /\ Min({Max({spart[p] : p \in Parts})} \cup OpenIn(AckedEntries)) > srcv
    /\ srcv' = Min({Max({spart[p] : p \in Parts})} \cup OpenIn(AckedEntries))
--- END
